{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n『ALL MV COLLECTION～あの時の彼女たち～』\nのプレミアムイベントでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3つもやっちゃいました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"各イベントごと\n1人のメンバーにつき10名のファンの皆様が\n選ばれた感じですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/14/8279785/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず１つ目\n『お茶会』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー1人＋ファンの皆様5名\nを2回"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6人で\n神経衰弱をしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然どこにあるか覚えらんなかった(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は\n1回目は1ペア\n2回目は2ペア\nできたよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、前回は紙パックのお茶でしたが\n進化しました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペットボトルに！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして2つ目\n『似顔絵会』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログでよく絵を描いてたせいで\n絵がすごく上手くなってきちゃってました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10名皆様、\nそーっくりに描けたと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/14/8279785/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似顔絵リピーター\nって他2つのイベントよりも多かったと思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/14/8279785/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に\n『録音会』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎度お馴染み\nみんなが恥ずかしいやつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ中田のとこは\n全然\n恥ずかしいの無くて楽しかったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/14/8279785/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャラ的にそういうの来ないってのと\nメンタル強くなりすぎて恥ずかしいとか思わなくなったのと\n思いやりのあるファンの方々に恵まれたなあって思います(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田のもとへ来てくださったみなさん\n本当にありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/14/8279785/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/14/8279785/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰り道です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}